ry?", "No. It is a voluntary tool published in July 2025, with chapters on transparency, copyright, and safety and security, that providers can use to demonstrate compliance with Articles 53 and 55. The Commission and the AI Board have confirmed it as an adequate voluntary tool."]], "related": ["/ai-architect/", "/fractional-cto/", "/technical-due-diligence/"], "citations": [{"title": "The General-Purpose AI Code of Practice", "url": "https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/gpai-code-practice", "publisher": "European Commission"}, {"title": "Signatory Taskforce of the GPAI Code of Practice", "url": "https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/pages/signatory-taskforce-gpai-code-practice", "publisher": "European Commission"}, {"title": "European Commission issues guidelines for providers of general-purpose AI models", "url": "https://www.wilmerhale.com/en/insights/blogs/wilmerhale-privacy-and-cybersecurity-law/20250724-european-commission-issues-guidelines-for-providers-of-general-purpose-ai-models", "publisher": "WilmerHale", "date": "24 Jul 2025"}, {"title": "Overview of guidelines for GPAI models", "url": "https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/gpai-guidelines-overview/", "publisher": "artificialintelligenceact.eu"}, {"title": "EU AI Act news: rules on general-purpose AI start applying; guidelines and template for summary of training data finalised", "url": "https://www.mayerbrown.com/en/insights/publications/2025/08/eu-ai-act-news-rules-on-general-purpose-ai-start-applying-guidelines-and-template-for-summary-of-training-data-finalized", "publisher": "Mayer Brown", "date": "Aug 2025"}, {"title": "EU AI Act: European Commission publishes general-purpose AI Code of Practice", "url": "https://www.jonesday.com/en/insights/2025/08/eu-ai-act-european-commission-publishes-generalpurpose-ai-code-of-practice", "publisher": "Jones Day", "date": "Aug 2025"}, {"title": "Research note: EU AI Act GPAI enforcement", "url": "https://labs.cloudsecurityalliance.org/wp-content/